{"about_the_game":"\u2714\ufe0fMighty <strong>Power washer</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0fUnstoppable <strong>Jackhammer</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0fHandy-dandy <strong>spray gun</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0fDetermination, creativity, and <strong>will</strong><br><br>Be the boss, be the builder, be the manager\u2026 be yourself. <br>Equipped with a high-pressure washer,  jackhammer, and a highly addictive spray gun, you face the construction of a restaurant the world has never seen. Tear down walls, build, destroy, paint, and decorate, utilizing real physics, and dynamic lighting to bring empty space to life. Restore empty places, renovate items in need, fix what needs to be fixed, paint, decorate, build, destroy, think, and act. All this you\u2019ll find in Restaurant Builder.<br><br>Building a restaurant needs a lot of work, but it is quite rewarding and relaxing. The game is divided into 3 phases. The first phase is cleaning, selling, washing, and repairing. The second is the creation stage. Buying furniture, arranging, painting, decorating. The third is the opening or sale phase. You can sell the restaurant and create another one, or open it by hiring a team and inviting customers. YOU manage it all.<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br>\ud83d\udd28Super relaxing mechanics of painting walls with a spray gun<br>\ud83d\udd28Realistic demolition mechanics of tearing down walls into fragments with a jackhammer<br>\ud83d\udd28Fully dynamic lighting with day and night cycle<br>\ud83d\udd28Ability to renovate objects, colors of objects, and lights<br>\ud83d\udd28Players' beloved powerwash cleaner, utilizing the real physics of items<br>\ud83d\udd28An extensive task system that allows for a different order of execution<br>\ud83d\udd28Dozen of components for decorations and building awaits to be found, sold or bought<br>\ud83d\udd28Building walls, doors, windows with covering, floors, walls, and ceilings with various materials<br><br><br><strong>BUILD TO CREATE PERFECTION</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/3654191be11685383a30e69dc589021b.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/3654191be11685383a30e69dc589021b.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/3654191be11685383a30e69dc589021b.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feel the spirit of work within you, because quite a lot of effort is waiting for you. You will also have to move your head. Nothing will come up on its own. Put up doors, bricklayer, paint, tile, and much more<br><br><strong>DARE TO REPAIR</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/3357bfbce5e9027e519ecb3a9e47016e.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/3357bfbce5e9027e519ecb3a9e47016e.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/3357bfbce5e9027e519ecb3a9e47016e.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Learn one of Murphy's laws. What can go wrong? It's bound to break. Also, don't count on luck. Doors, windows, repaired doors, electronic equipment, lighting and much more will need repair. However, you will be rewarded with the end result. Well, and great music from the repaired jukebox.<br><br><strong>DECORATE TO BUILD ATMOSPHERE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/f54f0177bb132d1d2f7bd75e3c74a1b4.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/f54f0177bb132d1d2f7bd75e3c74a1b4.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/f54f0177bb132d1d2f7bd75e3c74a1b4.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>What is the most important thing in a restaurant? Atmosphere. Here only your creativity will be the limit. Choose the colors, place the objects, adjust the lighting, and hang the pictures. Light candles to add a touch of romance. Play with your freedom of choice.<br><br><strong>DESTROY TO MAKE IT BETTER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/c2786dd2d709ca67093cc6b09edf2727.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/c2786dd2d709ca67093cc6b09edf2727.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/c2786dd2d709ca67093cc6b09edf2727.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Before you create something, you must first tear it down. Heavy equipment awaits in your hands to knock down walls, doors, floors, and windows. Smash everything. And put it up from scratch. <br><br><strong>TIME TO LEAN, TIME TO CLEAN</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/e12c9b84a18b8efaabaa9e3ee3e8bf08.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/e12c9b84a18b8efaabaa9e3ee3e8bf08.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/e12c9b84a18b8efaabaa9e3ee3e8bf08.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you enter long-unoccupied rooms then they must be dirty. It's a good thing you have nimble hands, a pressure washer at hand, and no lack of determination. Let us hear &quot;this house is clean&quot; once again! Remove dirt, get rid of the trash, mop floors, vacuum dusty items <br><br><strong>CASH IS THE KING</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/2b7a00f770526e2886494d8ada4eb19f.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/2b7a00f770526e2886494d8ada4eb19f.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/2b7a00f770526e2886494d8ada4eb19f.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Money never sleeps. Adjust to the situation. Earn $ by selling unwanted items. Some of the can be worth more than others. Be sure not to sell too much, as everything can be useful in decorating your restaurant. You will earn a lot more by accepting various types of assignments. You can use the cash you earn to buy the necessary materials to finish your restaurant.<br><br><strong>NEVER GET BORED</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/1e4ba28336eda32310acc4a9474a73d6.poster.avif?t=1769972780\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/1e4ba28336eda32310acc4a9474a73d6.webm?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/extras/1e4ba28336eda32310acc4a9474a73d6.mp4?t=1769972780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There are a lot of ruined and forgotten interiors that are waiting to be rediscovered. It's up to you to get to know them all.<br><br><strong>RUN RESTAURANT<strong>- A good restaurant means a lot of customers, good waiters, and tasty food. Attract customers, hire a crew, and when you get bored, sell it all and start over.</strong></strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2235490?t=1769972780","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769972780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769972780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769972780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2461520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"\u2714\ufe0fMighty <strong>Power washer</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0fUnstoppable <strong>Jackhammer</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0fHandy-dandy <strong>spray gun</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0fDetermination, creativity, and <strong>will</strong><br><br>Be the boss, be the builder, be the manager\u2026 be yourself. <br>Equipped with a high-pressure washer,  jackhammer, and a highly addictive spray gun, you face the construction of a restaurant the world has never see